    if command == "bb":
        print("""usage: bb <command> [options]

Breadboard K3s cluster, emulator, and Fullsend operations CLI.

commands:
  status        Show detailed K3s workloads, thermal stats, and OpenShell state
  runs          List Actions workflow runs across repositories
  logs          Inspect a workflow run and view job logs (auto-selects failed/triage)
  tickets       Query emulator tickets from Jira, GitHub, and GitLab
  openshell     Inspect OpenShell gateway, profiles, sandboxes or reset gateway PVC
  seed          Seed demo tickets, CVE fixture, or run conformance triage

global flags:
  --domain <domain>   Target domain (defaults to bb.internal or local)
  --skill             Print complete version-matched operational guide (SKILL.md)
  --help, -h          Show this help message
  --version, -v, -V   Print version (bb 0.1.0) and exit

examples:
  ./scripts/bb
  ./scripts/bb status
  ./scripts/bb runs --repo all
  ./scripts/bb logs 50
  ./scripts/bb tickets --limit 10
""")
    elif command == "status":
        print("""usage: bb status [--domain <domain>]

Show detailed K3s cluster workloads, physical host thermal status,
OpenShell profiles, providers, active sandboxes, and emulator tickets.

